          "date_decided": "2015-12-16",
          "holding": "The court vacated orders removing reunification from the permanency plan because the juvenile court relied on a polygraph examination, holding that material the department may lawfully use as an investigative tool is not thereby admissible as evidence in an adjudicative proceeding.",
